      "writtenOn": "2023-05-16T18:01:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Will this cl even reduce the number of outputs? They\u0027ll still be qualified by their config hash which will change even if the prefix doesn\u0027t change.\n\nEnvironment variables are currently load-time, so they\u0027ll cause reanalysis and rebuilding in bazel. But we can switch them to be build settings which would be more configuration orthogonal to the product, and then they\u0027ll go to a folder with the same product name but a different config hash.",
      "parentUuid": "4d2c3e75_deca51db",
      "revId": "fd5c0b5f59312693b31aee00ae5f629178a86fca",
